custos
======

custos is an independent, clean-room implementation of PHP inspections whose
rule catalogue is modelled on "Php Inspections (EA Extended)"
(https://github.com/kalessil/phpinspectionsea, LGPL-2.1, (C) Vladimir Reznichenko).
No source code, messages, descriptions, documentation or test fixtures of that
project are included in this repository. Rule identifiers are reused so that
existing `@noinspection` suppressions keep working.

Third-party data
----------------
- JetBrains phpstorm-stubs (https://github.com/JetBrains/phpstorm-stubs),
  Apache License 2.0 — used to generate the embedded builtin symbol index.
